        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nicole Provis, Nicole Bradtke, Petra Martić, Renata Voráčová\n- Events: 1992 Dow Classic – Doubles, 2011 Jalisco Open – Doubles\n- Concepts: Most Watchable Player doubles titles\n\nFacts:\n- Nicole Provis had Nicole Bradtke as her partner in the 1992 Dow Classic – Doubles.\n- Petra Martić won the 2011 Jalisco Open – Doubles with Renata Voráčová as her partner.\n- Nicole Bradtke won more Most Watchable Player doubles titles than Petra Martić.",
